# Karkens Painting Company

> house painting serving San Tan Valley, AZ.

## Business

**Trade**: house painting
**Location**: San Tan Valley, AZ

## Services

- **Interior Painting**: We transform living rooms, bedrooms, kitchens, and more with smooth, even coats and clean edge work with minimal disruption, maximum impact.
- **Exterior Painting**: Our exterior painting process includes thorough surface prep and premium weather-resistant paints that stand up to Arizona's intense sun.
- **Cabinet Refinishing**: Give your kitchen or bathroom cabinets a fresh lease on life with professional-grade refinishing that's far more affordable than a full replacement.
- **Furniture Painting**: We apply protective stains and sealers to furniture, preserving the wood and enhancing its natural look season after season.
- **Door Painting**: Breath new life into worn out and peeling paint on any door. We specialize in making old look brand new making your home look amazing.
- **Drywall Repairs**: Have holes that need patch and paint or new sections added. Our team has the skills to repair any drywall issue you might have.
- **Garage Painting**: We handle surface prep before we paint, so every garage door is smooth and ready for a lasting professional looking finish.
- **Gate Painting**: Don't let the Arizona sun keep your gate looking damaged. Our expert team will bring life back to sun-bleached wood or protect your iron with the best materials for lasting results.
- **and More!**: If you don't see it on our site, ask us and our friendly staff will get back to you ASAP. We love our work and want you to love it too.

## About

When you choose KARKENS, you’re choosing a local family who genuinely cares about the work we do and the people we serve.

